OL,3,CChampions in 1976 and iconic kits:
OL,4,CSouthampton's history with the FA Cup
OL,6,FSouthampton FC was formed in 1885.
OL,7,FTheir one major trophy: winning the FA
OL,8,FCup nearly 50 years ago.
OL,10,FOn May 1, 1976 Southampton defeated
OL,11,FManchester United 1-0. Bobby Stokes
OL,12,Fscored the winning goal for Saints.
OL,14,FHe was later named man-of-the-match,
OL,15,Fan accolade which won him a car. He
OL,16,Fcouldn't drive!
OL,18,FThat side boasted experienced players,
OL,19,Flike Mick Channon and Peter Osgood,
OL,20,Fbut were massive underdogs.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
