OL,3,CChampions in 1976 and iconic kits:
OL,4,CSouthampton's history with the FA Cup
OL,6,FSouthampton, a then Division Two team,
OL,7,Fup against Division One giants
OL,8,FManchester United.
OL,10,FRoad to Wembley
OL,12,FThe path to the semi-finals of this
OL,13,Fseason's tournament has been far from
OL,14,Fstraight forward and included the
OL,15,Fscalps of two Premier League clubs.
OL,17,F(Premier League and EFL Championship
OL,18,Fteams join at Round Three)
OL,20,FRound Three: January 10 - Doncaster
OL,21,FRovers 2-3 Southampton
