OL,3,CChampions in 1976 and iconic kits:
OL,4,CSouthampton's history with the FA Cup
OL,6,FRound Four: February 14 - Southampton
OL,7,F2-1 Leicester City
OL,9,FRound Five: March 8 - Fulham 0- 1
OL,10,FSouthampton
OL,12,FQuarter Final: April 4 - Southampton 2-
OL,13,F1 Arsenal
OL,15,FSaints manager Lawrie McMenemy was a
OL,16,Fbig character who went on to guide
OL,17,FSouthampton to their best ever seasons
OL,18,F- including second place in Division
OL,19,FOne.
