OL,3,CChampions in 1976 and iconic kits:
OL,4,CSouthampton's history with the FA Cup
OL,6,FSouthampton have only made it to the
OL,7,FFA Cup final once since then: 23 years
OL,8,Fago in Cardiff. They lost on that
OL,9,Foccasion 1-0 to Premier League side
OL,10,FArsenal.
OL,12,FSouthampton famously wore yellow in
OL,13,Fthe 1976 final - something they
OL,14,Frepeated in 2003.
OL,16,FThe club have produced a new 1976-
OL,17,Fstyle yellow strip to commemorate
OL,18,Fthis, selling them to fans for #125.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
