OL,3,CChampions in 1976 and iconic kits:
OL,4,CSouthampton's history with the FA Cup
OL,6,FSaints have worn the same shirt in
OL,7,Feach round of the FA Cup this season,
OL,8,Fand will wear them again at Wembley -
OL,9,Fincluding their allocation of 33-
OL,10,Fthousand travelling fans.
OL,12,FReporting History sees journalists
OL,13,Fjoin News At Ten anchor Tom Bradby to
OL,14,Frevisit their remarkable on-the-day
OL,15,Freports of the defining events of the
OL,16,Fmodern age. Listen to the episodes
OL,17,Fbelow...
